  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd74264524ca9792102/step-b5c06100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Grate carrot(see ingredients), then squeeze out any excess moisture using a paper towel.\n• Thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• TIP: Removing excess liquid from the carrot will help the fritters crisp up in the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd74264524ca9792102/step-8c2e4f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine corn, carrot, the plain flour, egg, milk, Nan’s special seasoning and Cheddar cheese.\n• Season with pepper.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes. Mix well to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd74264524ca9792102/step-6fed9320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture, in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don’t flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person.\n• TIP: Add extra oil between batches as needed",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd74264524ca9792102/step-2c2fe330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of the balsamic vinegar and olive oil.\n• Season with salt and pepper, then add apple and spinach & rocket mix. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd74264524ca9792102/step-9e589e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Nan’s sweetcorn and fetta fritters, fries and apple salad between plates.\n• Drizzle dill & parsley mayonnaise over the fritters.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84bd74264524ca9792102/step-9c520850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
